  "title": "Zigbee CL Touchlink: Utility commands lack inter-PAN transaction ID",
  "description": "Only the touchlink commissioning command set (cmd id 0x00-0x3f) shall\nbe transmitted using the inter-PAN transmission service and begin\nwith the 32-bit inter-PAN transaction ID. The commissioning utility\ncommand set (0x40-0xff) are transmitted using the standard unicast\ntransmission service and lack the transaction ID.\n\nSee the Zigbee Cluster Library specification 13.3 and 13.3.4.6.\nhttps://zigbeealliance.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/07-5123-08-Zigbee-Cluster-Library.pdf\n\nFix #19707",
  "state": "merged",
